   "source": [
    "## BTSP in a T-maze"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e2cefa1e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "* T-maze, largely fixed direction navigation, randomly selecting target arm on each trajectory\n",
    "* CA3: 40 preset place fields\n",
    "* CA1: \n",
    "  * Hebbian learning + BTSP learning at targeted neurons\n",
    "  * BTSP learning: long-tailed (pre) Hebbian learning with a high output firing rate considered (occurs at every repeat)\n",
    "  * (1) 1 cell, receives BTSP signal at a reward location\n",
    "  * (2) 6 cells, with 4 receiving BTSP signals (reward branch, wrong branch, split and start, respectively) \n",
    "\n",
    "Evaluate resulting CA1 neuron place field properties"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "02e6adb4",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
